\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Dn Vs Dollar; Market Eyes Dlr-Mark Trades \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 September 1997\par 11:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is weakening against the dollar and strengthening against the Deutsche mark in quiet trading Friday. \par \par \uc2  At 0929 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 195.61 to 195.66 forints, up from 194.25 to 194.30 forints in mid-session trading Thursday. They quoted the mark at 109.80 to 109.85 forints, down from 110.01 to 110.03 forints. \par \par \uc2  The forint is trading at its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses a fixing basket made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark to establish the band. \par \par \uc2  'It's really calm. The forint opened at around 195.50 to the dollar, right at the (strongest point) on the band,' said Gabor Liener, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Raiffeisen Unicbank Rt. in Budapest. 'The forint's just following the dollar-mark trading.' \par \par \uc2  Liener said he expects the dollar's movements against the German \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to drive the forint next week, and that the Hungarian unit should remain at its strongest point against the fixing basket. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Thursday at 194.26 forints, down from 194.56 forints Wednesday. It fixed the mark at 110.12 forints Thursday, compared with 109.92 forints Wednesday. Friday's fixing will be released after 1000 GMT. \par \par \uc2  The three-month interbank forint offered rates rose to 20.14% Friday from Thursday's 20.13%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-09-97 \par \par \uc2  0936GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9j06zba\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
