\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Steady Vs Dlr, Traders Eye Dlr-Mark Ranges \b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 September 1997\par 12:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is little changed against the dollar Friday, with dealers keeping their eyes riveted on changes in the dollar's levels against the Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  At 952 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 197.28 to 197.33 forints, down slightly from 197.38 to 197.43 forints in mid-session trading Thursday. They quoted the mark at 108.67 to 108.70 forints, up from 108.57 to 108.62 forints. \par \par \uc2  'It's been exciting Friday,' said a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a major Hungarian bank in Budapest. 'The dollar-mark (ranges) have been moving around quite a bit, and the forint's been following those.' \par \par \uc2  As the forint has moved, it's weakened slightly from Thursday on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses a fixing basket made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark to establish the band. \par \par \uc2  At around 930 GMT, the forint was seen at 2.21% from the band's midpoint, on the forint's strong side of the band. In mid-session trading Thursday the forint was 2.25% from the midpoint. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Thursday at 197.19 forints, down from 197.65 forints Wednesday. It fixed the mark at 108.66 forints Thursday compared with 108.42 forints Wednesday. Friday's fixing will be released after 1000 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 20.13% Friday, unchanged from Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1002GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9506n02\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
