\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Weaker Vs Basket; Seen Rebounding This Week \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 September 1997\par 14:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is slightly weaker against its fixing basket in moderate trading Monday, amid a firming dollar on international markets and recent drops on European stock exchanges including the Budapest bourse. \par \par \uc2  The forint is trading 8 to 12 fillers, or about 2.20%, from its mid-point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses a fixing basket made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark to establish the band. \par \par \uc2  There are 100 fillers in a forint. Usually the forint trades within one or two fillers of its strongest point on the band. \par \par \uc2  'The weakening of the forint started last Thursday as a reaction to the general drop on the equities markets in Europe and on the Budapest Stock Exchange,' said dealer Andras Szanto at European Commercial Bank in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  Szanto said he sees no spillover from continued \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakness in Southeast Asia and he expects the forint this week to regain its usual strong position at the bottom of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  At 1158 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 196.91 to 196.96 forints, up from 195.44 to 195.49 forints in the morning session Friday. They quoted the mark at 108.51 to 108.56 forints, down from 108.73 to 108.76 forints. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 01-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1207GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9106kdz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
