\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Weaker Vs Dlr With Cyclical Factors Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 1997\par 12:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is weakening in thin trading Thursday against the dollar, caused in part by demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Hungarian exporters paying their end-of-month bills. \par \par \uc2  At 0944 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 196.83 to 196.88 forints, up from 195.36 to 195.41 forints in mid-session trading Wednesday. They quoted the mark at 108.41 to 108.46 forints, down from 108.54 to 108.57 forints. \par \par \uc2  The forint is trading a few fillers from its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses a fixing basket made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark to establish the band. \par \par \uc2  There are 100 fillers in a forint. \par \par \uc2  'The forint keeps swinging to its present level from its strongest point on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band,' said dealer Csaba Fekete at European Commercial Bank in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  The forint's moves are partly due to the moves of the dollar on the international markets and to the forint's usual end-of-month weakening resulting from foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  payment obligations by Hungarian companies, Fekete said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Wednesday at 195.51 forints, slightly down from 195.53 forints Tuesday. It fixed the mark at 108.57 forints Wednesday, compared with 108.49 forints Tuesday. Thursday's fixing will be released shortly. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 20.12% Thursday, unchanged from Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 28-08-97 \par \par \uc2  1002GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8s06dy9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
