\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Weaker Vs Dollar; Market Eyes Dollar-DM Trade \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 1997\par 11:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is weaker against the dollar Thursday, as traders await a decision on monetary policy by the Deutsche Bundesbank amid fading expectations of a rise in German interest rates. \par \par \uc2  At 0846 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 199.24 to 199.29 forints, up from 197.76 to 197.81 forints in midday trading Tuesday. They quoted the mark at 107.39 to 107.44 forints, down from 107.58 to 107.63 forints. \par \par \uc2  Wednesday was a national holiday in Hungary. \par \par \uc2  The forint is trading near its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses a fixing basket made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark to establish the band. \par \par \uc2  Dealers have been focused on the Bundesbank's policy meeting Thursday and any signs that the bank may raise interest rates, said Orsolya Liptai, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at the Hungarian Credit Bank in Budapest, which is owned by ABN AMRO Bank of the Netherlands. \par \par \uc2  That's kept the forint within relatively narrow ranges, Liptai said. \par \par \uc2  'Nobody thinks the Bundesbank is going to raise its rates, but the waiting is keeping things very uncertain,' she said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Tuesday at 197.80 forints, up from 195.88 forints Monday. It fixed the mark at 107.61 forints Tuesday, compared with 108.00 forints Monday. Thursday's fixing will be released after 1000 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 20.11% Thursday, unchanged from Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0920GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8l066cm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
