\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Sharply Higher Vs Dollar In Light Trade \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 August 1997\par 11:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is sharply higher against the dollar and weaker versus the Deutsche mark in light trading Monday. \par \par \uc2  At 0945 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 195.72 to 195.77 forints, down sharply from 197.95 to 197.80 forints in mid-session trading Friday. They quoted the mark at 108.06 to 108.11 forints, up from 107.49 to 107.54 forints. \par \par \uc2  As expected, the big drop in the dollar against the forint, driven by the dollar's weakening against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has been balanced by a strengthening of the mark against the Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  That's kept the forint Monday at its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses a fixing basket made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark to establish the band. \par \par \uc2  'There's not much trading going on,' said a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at the Budapest subsidiary of a major European bank, adding that the market appears to be unruffled by Friday's sharp fall in the U.S. equity market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Friday at 198.05 forints, up from 197.16 forints Thursday. It fixed the mark at 107.41 forints Friday, compared to 107.66 forints Thursday. Monday's fixing will be released after 1000 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 20.11% Monday, unchanged from Friday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0955GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8i063j8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
