icated at 20.11% Tuesday, unchanged from Monday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0936GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8c05wd5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
