\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Dn Vs Dlr; Seen Up Vs Basket In Coming Days \b0\par\par\uc2 285 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juni 1997\par 11:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is weakening against the dollar and steady against the Deutsche mark in thin trading Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  At 922 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 184.26 to 184.31 forints, up from 183.70 to 183.75 forints in mid-session trading Monday. They quoted the mark at 106.80 to 106.85 forints, essentially unchanged from mid-session ranges Monday. \par \par \uc2  The forint has been trading Tuesday at between 20 and 30 fillers from its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, said Gabor Jakab, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at BNP-Dresdner Bank Hungaria Rt. in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  There are 100 fillers in one forint. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's band is 4.5%, and the forint is allowed to move 2.25% either way from the midpoint. \par \par \uc2  'There's a general lack of interest on the market (Tuesday),' Jakab said, adding that the forint hasn't moved noticeably on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band since Monday. \par \par \uc2  However, he predicted a gradual strengthening of the forint on the band in coming days back to its usual place, which is within five or 10 fillers from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bid. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Monday at 183.62 forints, up from 182.38 forints Friday. It fixed the mark at 106.87 forints Monday, compared to 107.32 forints Friday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark. Tuesday's fixing will be released after 1000 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 21.15% Tuesday, unchanged from Monday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-06-97 \par \par \uc2  0931GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt63040w3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
