\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Weakening Vs Dollar In Lackluster Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Mai 1997\par 11:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is weakening against the dollar and is up slightly against the Deutsche mark in slow trading Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  At 936 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 181.20 to 181.25 forints, up from 180.67 to 180.72 forints in mid-session trading Tuesday. They quoted the mark at 106.28 to 106.31 forints, down just a touch from 106.35 to 106.38 forints. \par \par \uc2  As usual, the forint is following the moves of the dollar on international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, said Miklos Csepai, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Mezobank Rt. in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  'It's not too active Wednesday,' Csepai said. Despite the forint's overall weakening against the dollar since Tuesday, he added, 'Since the opening of Wednesday's session the forint has strengthened against the dollar by about 15 fillers.' \par \par \uc2  There are 100 fillers in one forint. \par \par \uc2  The trader added that during the remainder of Wednesday and into Thursday he expects the forint to remain near its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way from the bank's parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Tuesday at 180.59 forints, up from 179.63 forints Monday. It fixed the mark at 106.42 forints Tuesday, compared to 106.57 forints Monday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark. Wednesday's fixing will be released after 1000 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 21.14% Wednesday, unchanged from Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0944GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5e03fl3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
