\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Weaker Vs Dollar, Up Slightly Against DEM \b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 April 1997\par 12:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The dollar's strength continued to bear down on the Hungarian forint Friday, with the forint weakening against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but strengthening slightly versus the Deutsche mark in moderately active trading. \par \par \uc2  At 1028 GMT, after the close of the regular trading session, traders quoted the dollar at 180.53 to 180.58 forints, up from 179.98 to 180.03 forints in mid-session trading Thursday. They quoted the mark at 104.69 to 104.74 forints, down from 104.79 to 104.84 forints. \par \par \uc2  The forint was trading Friday in ranges within five fillers from its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, said Laszlo Egyed, dealer at West LB Hungaria Rt. in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  There are 100 fillers in one forint. \par \par \uc2  The bank's band of 4.5% allows the forint to move 2.25% either way from parity. \par \par \uc2  'There have been some movements Friday,' Egyed said. 'The forint's been following the dollar-mark trading.' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Friday at 180.26 forints, up from 179.84 forints Thursday. It fixed the mark at 104.77 forints Friday, compared to 104.83 forints Thursday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 21.27% Friday, unchanged from Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 11-04-97 \par \par \uc2  1033GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4b02mcc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
