\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Higher Vs Dollar, Seen Strong Vs Basket \b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 12:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is strengthening against the dollar and weakening against the Deutsche mark in calm trading Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  At 1055 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 177.02 to 177.07 forints, down from 177.35 to 177.40 forints in mid-session trading Monday. They quoted the mark at 103.78 to 103.81 forints, up from 103.69 to 103.74 forints. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday the forint has maintained the strength it began showing in the middle of Monday's session and is trading near its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, said Orsolya Liptai, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at the Hungarian Credit Bank in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's band is 4.5% and allows the forint to move 2.25% either way from parity. \par \par \uc2  Traders said Monday forint buying was generated by the government's announcement that it will lower the monthly devaluation rate of the forint to 1.1% from 1.2% effective April 1. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday is 'just an average day,' Liptai said, adding that she expects the forint to remain strong for at least a few more days. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Monday at 177.30 forints, down from 177.63 forints Friday. It fixed the mark at 103.80 forints Monday, compared to 103.66 forints Friday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark. Tuesday's fixing will be released shortly. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 21.24% Tuesday, unchanged from Monday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 11-03-97 \par \par \uc2  1111GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3b01pmp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
