\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Postabank News Seen Driving Hungary Forint Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 12:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--Trading in the Hungarian forint has been sluggish Monday as the market awaits further news about rumor-plagued Postabank, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 1140 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 175.93 to 175.98 forints, up from 175.83 to 175.88 forints late Friday after the close of the regular trading session. \par \par \uc2  Traders quoted the mark at 103.94 to 103.97 forints, barely changed from 103.95 to 103.98 forints late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Trading ranges Monday have generally mirrored those of Friday, with the forint trading about 55 to 60 basis points from its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, according to Mihaly Donka, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at BNP-Dresdner Bank Hungaria in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band allows the forint to move 2.25% either way. \par \par \uc2  'Activity Monday has been very slight,' Donka said. 'Everybody's waiting for news on Postabank and the government decision.' \par \par \uc2  Donka was referring to the government's investigation of the cause of the run on Postabank, the nation's No. 2 bank. Bank officials estimate depositors withdrew 21 billion forints between Friday morning and Sunday afternoon. \par \par \uc2  In a rare twist in forint trading, domestic news about Postabank has replaced developments on foreign markets as the major driving force on the Budapest \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, traders said. \par \par \uc2  'We're waiting for the outcome of the Postabank business,' said Andras Szekely, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealing at the Hungarian Credit Bank (MHB) in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-03-97 \par \par \uc2  1145GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3301h07\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
