ed to 21.43% at the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 26-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1334GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2q01btz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
