\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Weakens Vs Dollar, Quiet Afternoon Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Februar 1997\par 12:18\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is weakening against the dollar and strengthening against the Deutsche mark in thin trading Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  At 1106 GMT, just after the close of the morning trading session, traders quoted the dollar at 172.37 to 172.42 forints, up from 171.14 to 171.19 forints in mid-session trading Monday. They quoted the mark at 103.30 to 103.34 forints, down from 103.53 to 103.57 forints. \par \par \uc2  Trading activity during the morning decreased from Monday, according to Peter Luczo, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Inter-Europa Bank in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  'Since the start of the day we've been about five basis points from the bottom of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band,' Luczo said, referring to the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The forint usually trades against the dollar and the mark near its strongest point at the bottom of the band. \par \par \uc2  Luczo said he expects the market to remain quiet Tuesday afternoon. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Tuesday at 172.28 forints, up from 171.23 forints Monday. It fixed the mark at 103.29 forints Tuesday, compared to 103.56 forints Monday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 21.77% Tuesday, compared to 21.79% at the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 11-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1118GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2b00xyu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
