\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Steady Vs Dollar In Slow Trading Friday \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Februar 1997\par 15:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint stayed steady against the dollar and weakened versus the Deutsche mark in placid trading Friday. \par \par \uc2  At the close of regular trading at 1100 GMT traders quoted the dollar at 171.08 to 171.13 forints, virtually unchanged from 171.09 to 171.14 forints in mid-session trading Thursday. They quoted the mark at 103.64 to 103.67 forints, up from 103.23 to 103.26 forints. \par \par \uc2  Throughout trading Friday the forint stayed near its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, according to Szabolcs Brezina, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at the Bank of Credit and Commerce (K&H) in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band is 4.5% around the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily parity rate, which means the forint is allowed to move 2.25% either way. \par \par \uc2  'There was very little movement Friday, with low turnover,' Brezina said. He said the market may pick up next week depending on news from this weekend's meeting of leaders from the G-7 Group of Seven major industrialized countries in Berlin. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Friday at 171.70 forints, up from 171.09 forints Thursday. It fixed the mark at 103.40 forints Friday, compared to 103.55 forints Thursday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 21.80% Friday, compared to 21.82% at the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1411GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2700sez\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
